  "summary": "I’ve been a software engineer for over 17 years, always focused on solving real customer problems and learning whatever new technology can help us do it better, most recently in artificial intelligence.\n\nAt Puppet by Perforce, I took our AI strategy from a handful of research experiments all the way to a production product. I led the team that built Infra Assistant, our first AI‑powered offering, which lets users ask natural language questions about their entire Puppet environment. We shipped it in June 2025 as part of Puppet Enterprise Advanced, and customers have told us it cuts hours of manual investigation down to seconds.\n\nToday I still own our AI roadmap, mentor engineers on everything from prompt design to scalable model deployment, and look for every chance to bring AI into our products. If you’re curious about how infrastructure teams can get real value from AI, send me a note—I’d love to connect.",
