      "description": "Key Accomplishments (entire tenure):\n\n* Led the integration of an acquired company’s technology stack, enabling the launch of a new product offering that quickly became one of our top earners.\n* Architected and drove a micro-service, SaaS-based approach to Puppet products, delivering a fully functional MVP in just two months.\n* Designed and built a scaling solution that automated a previously manual, complex process, eliminating lengthy documentation and saving the team countless hours.\n* Pitched and led a tiger team to tackle CI bottlenecks, creating internal tooling that streamlined our CI matrix and cut feedback cycles from days to under an hour.\n* Partnered with field solutions to redesign the Puppet Enterprise Installer, drastically reducing support escalations.\n* Spearheaded the research, prototyping, and productization of Infra Assistant, our first AI-powered feature in Puppet Enterprise Advanced, which customers now use to get instant natural-language insights into their environments.\n\nRoles & Responsibilities:\n\n* Meet every other week with the CTO’s office to compare notes, align on AI initiatives, and stay on top of industry trends.\n* Drive our AI strategy and roadmap, defining new AI-powered features, leading prototyping through productionization, and mentoring engineers on best practices for prompt design, model deployment, and application integration.\n* Collaborate with executives and cross-functional teams to define feature specifications and roadmaps.\n* Mentor junior engineers, guiding best practices in design, testing, and delivery.\n* Lead Agile rituals, estimate workloads, and ensure on-time delivery against commitments.\n* Work with product management to assess feasibility of roadmap items six months and beyond.",
